<Page title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How affiliate links work on this site." updated="October 16, 2026">
  <p>{site.name} participates in affiliate programs, including the ClickBank affiliate network. When you click a link to a product on this site and make a purchase, we may receive a commission from the seller.</p>
  <p>This comes at no additional cost to you. The price you pay is the same whether or not you use our link.</p>
  <p>Affiliate relationships do not influence what we write. We describe what a product contains, what it costs and what the evidence shows, including its limitations, regardless of whether we earn a commission on it.</p>
  <p>We do not sell products ourselves, are not the manufacturer of any product we write about, and do not handle orders, payments or refunds.</p>
  <p>This disclosure is made in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in Advertising.</p>
</Page>
